@startuml
title Data-flow and trust boundary
rectangle "Learner personal state" as P
rectangle "Pedagogical channel" as G
rectangle "Approved corpus spans" as E
rectangle "Retrieval and claim gate" as R
rectangle "Model prompt / answer" as M
rectangle "Private evaluation outputs" as V
P --> G : style only
E --> R : evidence + version
G -[hidden]-> R
R --> M : evidence, never learner facts as proof
M --> R : candidate claims/citations
R --> V : provenance and metrics
note right of R
Only approved spans support
factual claims or citations.
end note
@enduml
